<title>BELGIUM: EU set to agree C.Lyonnais emergency aid-EU source.</title>
<headline>EU set to agree C.Lyonnais emergency aid-EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission was set on Wednesday to approve an emergency aid of about 4 billion French francs ($785 million) for embattled bank Credit Lyonnais and start a probe into a new revised rescue plan, a European Union source said.</p>
<p>EU Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert was expected to annouce the decision at a new conference in Brussels at 1015 GMT.</p>
</text>
